msgid "a fire rampages through one of the huts, destroying it."
msgstr "o lume arrasa unha das cabanas, destruíndoa."

#: script/room.js:1496
msgid "A Firelit Room"
msgstr "Un Cuarto Alumeado"

#: script/path.js:177
msgid "a fleet mark. the emblem of a society that is not there any more."
msgstr "unha marca de flota. o emblema dunha sociedade que xa non existe."

#: script/lab.js:325
msgid "a floor drain, and a faint slope in the concrete leading to it."
msgstr "un desaugadoiro no chan, e unha lene pendente no formigón que leva ata el."

